                <p class="isSelectedEnd" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span>📝Weather
                      Notice</span></strong><span><br>
                  </span></p>
                <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This information is compiled by
                    Apex Wx using available weather observations, computer
                    models, and forecast data and may not reflect current
                    conditions or subsequent forecast updates. For the latest
                    official watches, warnings, and advisories for northern
                    Maine, especially during severe or extreme weather, always
                    consult </span><a href="https://www.weather.gov/car/"><span>NWS
                      Caribou</span></a><span>.</span></p>
                <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Apex Wx makes no guarantee
                    regarding the accuracy or completeness of information
                    presented here. Weather observations, data feeds,
                    instruments, and computer models may contain errors or
                    experience interruptions beyond the forecaster's control.
                    Apex Wx is also not responsible for the accuracy,
                    timeliness, or availability of information provided by
                    linked external websites.</span></p>
